# Both images build from the repository root, so this is the single ignore file
# that applies; per-package ones would never be read.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/.next
**/coverage
**/*.tsbuildinfo

.git
.github
**/.env
**/.env.*
!**/.env.example
**/*.log

README.md
INTEGRATION.md
LICENSE
docker-compose.yml
